* MMBTA42_MMBTA92.lib -- Diodes Inc. SPICE cards, concatenated.
* ONLY change vs the files as downloaded: in the MMBTA92 card the wrapped comment
* line 'Transistor' got a leading '*'. Without it LTspice/ngspice read it as a
* transmission-line element and refuse to load the file.
* Vendor header, disclaimer and parameters are otherwise unchanged.

